      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Structure: parseable document, known element types, no duplicate ids, no\ndangling bindings, image bytes present. Geometry (rotation-aware): frames\ndon't overlap, text fits its container, nothing escapes or squats on a frame, free\ntexts don't collide, arrows don't cross strangers, arrowheads land outside their\ntarget. Style: 4.5:1 contrast, no text over images, house fonts only.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Structure: parseable document, known element types, no duplicate ids, no\ndangling bindings, image bytes present. Geometry (rotation-aware): frames\ndon't overlap, text fits its container, nothing escapes or squats on a frame, free\ntexts don't collide, arrows don't cross strangers, arrowheads land outside their\ntarget. Style: 4.5:1 contrast, no text over images, house fonts only.",
